# <type>(<scope>): <subject>            <-- 72 chars max, imperative mood
#
# <body>
#
# The subject says WHAT changed. The body says WHY, which is the part the
# diff cannot tell anyone. Prefer:
#
#   - What was wrong before, concretely enough to recognise it
#   - Why this fix rather than an obvious alternative
#   - What is deliberately NOT addressed, and why
#
# A body that restates the diff in prose adds nothing. A body that explains
# a decision saves the next person an hour.
#
# Types: feat fix refactor perf docs test build ci chore revert
# Wrap the body at 78 characters.
